#. (itstool) path: component/name
#: org.kde.kgeography.appdata.xml:11
msgid "KGeography"
msgstr "KGeography"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: org.kde.kgeography.appdata.xml:12
msgid "Geography learning tool"
msgstr "Alat za učenje geografije"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.kgeography.appdata.xml:14
msgid "KGeography is a geography learning tool, which allows you to learn about the political divisions of some countries (divisions, capitals of those divisions and their associated flags if there are some)."
msgstr "KGeography je alat za učenje geografije koji omogućuje upoznavanje s političkim jedinicama pojedinih država, njihovim glavnim gradovima i pripadajućim zastavama."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.kgeography.appdata.xml:15
msgid "Features:"
msgstr "Mogućnosti:"

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.kgeography.appdata.xml:17
msgid "Browse the maps clicking in a map division to see its name, capital and flag"
msgstr "Pregledajte karte klikom na jedinicu kako biste vidjeli njezin naziv, glavni grad i zastavu"

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.kgeography.appdata.xml:18
msgid "The game tells you a map division name and you have to click on it"
msgstr "Igra vam zadaje naziv jedinice na karti, a vi je morate označiti"

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.kgeography.appdata.xml:19
msgid "The game tells you a capital and you have to guess the division it belongs to"
msgstr "Igra vam zadaje glavni grad, a vi morate pogoditi kojoj jedinici pripada"

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.kgeography.appdata.xml:20
msgid "The game tells you a division and you have to guess its capital"
msgstr "Igra vam zadaje jedinicu, a vi morate pogoditi njezin glavni grad"

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.kgeography.appdata.xml:21
msgid "The game shows you a map division flag and you have to guess its name"
msgstr "Igra vam pokazuje zastavu jedinice, a vi morate pogoditi njezin naziv"

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.kgeography.appdata.xml:22
msgid "The game tells you a map division name and you have to guess its flag"
msgstr "Igra vam zadaje naziv jedinice na karti, a vi morate pogoditi njezinu zastavu"

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.kgeography.appdata.xml:23
msgid "The game shows an empty map and you have to place divisions on it one by one"
msgstr "Igra vam prikazuje praznu kartu, a vi na nju morate smjestiti jedinice jednu po jednu"

#. (itstool) path: screenshot/caption
#: org.kde.kgeography.appdata.xml:36
msgid "Training geography with KGeography"
msgstr "Učenje geografije uz KGeography"
